    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-14T22:32:42+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-14T22:32:42+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-14T13:02:42Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-14T13:02:42Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred in the Bight, is slowly drifting to the southeast to be located west of Tasmania on Saturday and in the Tasman Sea on Monday. A ridge of high pressure is expected to remain over South Australia. A trough over QLD pushes into the far northeast of SA from later Saturday through to later Monday. A trough of low pressure moves in the far west of South Australia later on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-08-14T21:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-15T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-14T11:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-14T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Light winds.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-15T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-16T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-14T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-15T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. The chance of morning fog south of Streaky Bay. Slight chance of a shower, most likely in the afternoon and evening. Light winds becoming easterly 15 to 20 km/h in the morning then becoming light in the middle of the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 6 with daytime temperatures reaching around 18.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:30am to 2:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 4 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-08-16T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-17T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-15T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-16T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of morning fog west of Ceduna. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the afternoon and evening. Light winds becoming southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the late afternoon then becoming light in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 6 with daytime temperatures reaching around 18.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-17T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-18T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-16T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-17T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of morning fog. Medium chance of showers south of Streaky Bay, most likely in the afternoon. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Light winds becoming northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to around 6 with daytime temperatures reaching around 20.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-08-18T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-19T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-17T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-18T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Ceduna in the morning and afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 11 with daytime temperatures reaching between 19 and 23.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
